{"id":"n67644-1-7","stage":5,"title":"염소 · 山羊","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67644-1-7-1","ko":"저건 꼭 송아지같이 생겼는데 무슨 동물이지?","zh":"那东西看起来简直像小牛，到底是什么动物呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저건","meaning":"那个","explanation":"저거：那个；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"저거","audio":"/audio/d3476ad2b3a3fd79be3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29739","senseId":"1","lemma":"저거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저건","audio":"/audio/a4b00c516a5f53fc895f.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"仿佛，好像","explanation":"꼭：仿佛，好像。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"3","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"송아지같이","meaning":"牛犊，小牛","explanation":"송아지：牛犊，小牛；같이：表示“像……一样”；在时间词后也可强调该时间。","readings":[{"term":"송아지","audio":"/audio/6af13431e66d262b0e41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64817","senseId":"1","lemma":"송아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"송아지같이","audio":"/audio/8cfebfb18fb5e29c5ffe.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼는데","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼는데","audio":"/audio/fa0607c5b2594191100d.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"동물이지?","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"1","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동물이지","audio":"/audio/ce78052fa5764a66a328.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d3476ad2b3a3fd79","term":"저거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/d3476ad2b3a3fd79be3b.mp3","entryId":"29739","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저거"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"仿佛，好像","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"非常相似地。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"6af13431e66d262b","term":"송아지","zh":"牛犊，小牛","audio":"/audio/6af13431e66d262b0e41.mp3","entryId":"64817","definition":"幼小的牛。","pronunciation":["송아지"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"在生物界的两条分支中，从食物中获取营养，并可以自由活动的生物。","pronunciation":["동ː물"]}],"audio":"/audio/74535958d22425d69064.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67644-1-7-2","ko":"머리에 뿔이 난 걸 보니 염소인 것 같은데.","zh":"看它头上长着角，应该是山羊吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"머리에","meaning":"头","explanation":"머리：头；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리에","audio":"/audio/706e62328b1459269ae9.mp3"}},{"text":"뿔이","meaning":"角","explanation":"뿔：角；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뿔","audio":"/audio/015be332bf5c41d84b76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61787","senseId":"1","lemma":"뿔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뿔이","audio":"/audio/60ff9aeaa5f5f8cd1536.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"长出，发，生","explanation":"나다：长出，发，生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"염소인","meaning":"山羊","explanation":"염소：山羊；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"염소","audio":"/audio/77c99bee18a00335e463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67644","senseId":"1","lemma":"염소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"염소인","audio":"/audio/6e4d035da6db8a2227ed.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"在人或动物身体中，包括脸和头发的脖子以上的部分。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"015be332bf5c41d8","term":"뿔","zh":"角","audio":"/audio/015be332bf5c41d84b76.mp3","entryId":"61787","definition":"牛或鹿等动物的头上长出的结实而尖利的东西。","pronunciation":["뿔"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"长出，发，生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"冒出皮肤表层或地面。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"77c99bee18a00335","term":"염소","zh":"山羊","audio":"/audio/77c99bee18a00335e463.mp3","entryId":"67644","definition":"体型比牛小，长有角，体色为褐色、黑色、白色等的作为家畜饲养的动物。","pronunciation":["염소"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f5bcdb5e074ad8557af.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.573,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67644","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":173,"sequenceScore":3.3997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那东西看起来简直像小牛，到底是什么动物呢？","看它头上长着角，应该是山羊吧。","最近物价上涨，外出吃饭的开销也变得有点负担了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那东西看起来简直像小牛，到底是什么动物呢？","看它头上长着角，应该是山羊吧。","最近物价上涨，外出吃饭的开销也变得有点负担了。"],"answer":1}]}
